1
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:05,767
<font color="white">外星人来袭</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:09,354
<font color="white">外星人来袭</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:11,898
<font color="white">移动至室内避难…</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:15,026 --> 00:00:16,027
<font color="white">为什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:16,111 --> 00:00:18,947
<font color="white">移动至室内避难…</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:47,786 --> 00:01:49,037
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:49,121 --> 00:01:52,624
<font color="white">-移动至室内避难…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-喂！振作一点！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:55,502 --> 00:01:57,629
<font color="white">来人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:58,630 --> 00:01:59,798
<font color="white">有人受伤了</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:05,262 --> 00:02:07,806
<font color="white">这究竟是怎么一回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:08,348 --> 00:02:11,351
<font color="white">不清楚 需要尽快确认状况</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:11,434 --> 00:02:12,602
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:28,118 --> 00:02:29,578
<font color="white">还好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:29,661 --> 00:02:30,787
<font color="white">出了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:31,872 --> 00:02:34,249
<font color="white">为何下手这么狠？</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:34,332 --> 00:02:37,085
<font color="white">小心！他们说不定会伤害我们</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:40,505 --> 00:02:42,173
<font color="white">如果又发生那种事…</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:45,427 --> 00:02:46,678
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:49,306 --> 00:02:52,058
<font color="white">井手先生 我们抵达现场了</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:52,142 --> 00:02:53,602
<font color="white">状况如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:53,685 --> 00:02:56,354
{\an8}<font color="white">似乎已经有人处理掉阿德罗斯了</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:56,855 --> 00:02:58,481
{\an8}<font color="white">现场有许多伤员</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:02:59,065 --> 00:03:02,027
<font color="white">看来这不只是阿德罗斯干的好事</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:04,154 --> 00:03:07,532
{\an8}<font color="white">（救护车）</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:11,286 --> 00:03:13,955
<font color="white">我们也还没有掌握状况</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:14,789 --> 00:03:18,251
<font color="white">毕竟因为一年前的那起事件</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:18,335 --> 00:03:21,338
<font color="white">监视器的数量受到限制</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:21,421 --> 00:03:24,174
<font color="white">很难了解详情</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:24,674 --> 00:03:26,927
<font color="white">普通民众拍摄的视频</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:27,010 --> 00:03:29,596
<font color="white">看来已经在社交媒体上疯传了</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:30,513 --> 00:03:32,390
<font color="white">好 播出来看看</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:37,229 --> 00:03:38,980
<font color="white">什么？这是…</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:39,856 --> 00:03:41,024
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:44,027 --> 00:03:46,446
<font color="white">这到底是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:48,531 --> 00:03:49,991
<font color="white">我想这恐怕是</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:50,533 --> 00:03:54,329
<font color="white">伊多说的“更进一步的觉醒”</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:55,163 --> 00:03:57,999
<font color="white">最糟糕的情况发生了</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:03:58,708 --> 00:04:01,002
<font color="white">只能这么解释了</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:02,462 --> 00:04:05,757
<font color="white">无法否认这个可能性</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:06,508 --> 00:04:10,053
<font color="white">不过我们不能急着下结论</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:12,138 --> 00:04:14,557
<font color="white">就是说啊 冷静一点 早田</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,601
<font color="white">不然</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:16,685 --> 00:04:19,271
<font color="white">还有什么可能性？</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:23,191 --> 00:04:24,234
<font color="white">抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:26,403 --> 00:04:27,570
<font color="white">总而言之</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:28,238 --> 00:04:29,698
<font color="white">我们先联络当事人的进次郎吧</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:30,282 --> 00:04:33,785
<font color="white">我从刚才就在尝试 却没有任何回应</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:33,868 --> 00:04:34,786
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:34,869 --> 00:04:36,830
<font color="white">他脱下奥特曼装甲了</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:36,913 --> 00:04:38,081
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:39,457 --> 00:04:42,502
<font color="white">我们要继续寻找那小子吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:04:44,087 --> 00:04:47,090
{\an8}<font color="white">诸星 你们先回来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:04:47,173 --> 00:04:48,216
<font color="white">收到</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:04:51,594 --> 00:04:53,138
<font color="white">早田！</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:04:53,221 --> 00:04:54,848
<font color="white">等一下 早田</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:04:55,974 --> 00:04:58,059
<font color="white">我去找进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:04:59,019 --> 00:05:00,562
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:00,645 --> 00:05:04,691
<font color="white">我以前跟进次郎谈过</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:06,526 --> 00:05:09,988
<font color="white">我告诉过他奥特曼是诅咒</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:11,865 --> 00:05:13,491
<font color="white">那个诅咒</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:14,117 --> 00:05:15,910
<font color="white">现在有了新的意义</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:17,162 --> 00:05:21,374
<font color="white">准备降临到我们父子身上</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:22,542 --> 00:05:24,961
<font color="white">我有那股强烈的预感</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:26,921 --> 00:05:28,965
<font color="white">让我去吧 井手</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:44,606 --> 00:05:46,107
<font color="white">怎么回事啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:50,779 --> 00:05:51,863
<font color="white">话说回来</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:05:52,363 --> 00:05:54,657
<font color="white">我怎么会在这种地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:56,993 --> 00:05:59,829
<font color="white">（复兴祈愿典礼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">佐山玲奈特别演唱会）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:00,413 --> 00:06:03,917
<font color="white">对了 我必须去典礼会场！</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:10,465 --> 00:06:12,217
<font color="white">发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:16,137 --> 00:06:17,555
<font color="white">必须快点联络才行</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:21,559 --> 00:06:22,602
<font color="white">不见了</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:28,441 --> 00:06:30,652
<font color="white">已经开始了是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:31,945 --> 00:06:33,780
<font color="white">那我们得加快脚步</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:36,241 --> 00:06:40,120
<font color="white">包括建设中的大楼在内</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">事发现场有四栋建筑物</font></font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:40,203 --> 00:06:42,497
<font color="white">彻底遭到破坏</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:44,457
<font color="white">也有许多人受伤</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:44,541 --> 00:06:47,877
<font color="white">场面依然相当混乱</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:47,961 --> 00:06:49,587
<font color="white">以上是记者在现场的报导</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:51,381 --> 00:06:53,800
<font color="white">有消息指出这起事件的开端</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:53,883 --> 00:06:57,053
<font color="white">是外星人袭击纪念典礼 进而引发的</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:57,137 --> 00:07:00,223
<font color="white">有人则认为奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">对外星人的攻击过于激烈</font></font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:00,306 --> 00:07:02,934
<font color="white">才会导致这场惨剧</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:03,017 --> 00:07:05,228
<font color="white">引发部分不满声浪</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:05,812 --> 00:07:09,232
<font color="white">因此今天我们将从都市灾害学的观点</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:09,315 --> 00:07:12,652
<font color="white">紧急邀请研究外星人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">以及奥特曼的专家</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:12,735 --> 00:07:18,199
<font color="white">帝都大学的大谷正继教授来到现场</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:18,283 --> 00:07:20,368
<font color="white">大谷教授 麻烦你了</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:20,452 --> 00:07:22,162
<font color="white">请多指教</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:22,245 --> 00:07:25,206
<font color="white">您对这场意外有什么看法？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:25,290 --> 00:07:26,416
<font color="white">（大谷正继）</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:26,499 --> 00:07:30,086
<font color="white">这个嘛 比起说是意外</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:33,673
<font color="white">我们认为这可以堪称是一场灾难</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:33,756 --> 00:07:35,133
<font color="white">这是我的观点</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:36,134 --> 00:07:38,887
<font color="white">灾害？那是什么意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:42,307
<font color="white">-这个嘛 大家可能不知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-你还好吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,933
<font color="white">-还好</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-从前啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:07:44,017 --> 00:07:48,480
<font color="white">在巨大奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">击退怪兽的活跃表现背后</font></font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:07:48,563 --> 00:07:51,357
<font color="white">其实也造成不少灾难</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:07:51,441 --> 00:07:53,151
<font color="white">而且近几年来</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:07:53,902 --> 00:07:57,739
<font color="white">确实常发生外星人相关的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:07:59,073 --> 00:08:04,996
<font color="white">我清楚新的奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">确实成功解决了许多事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,122
<font color="white">可是呢</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:06,206 --> 00:08:11,252
<font color="white">他们像过去一样带来了损害</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:11,336 --> 00:08:13,296
<font color="white">我们不能忽视这一点</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:13,379 --> 00:08:18,009
<font color="white">尽管奥特曼解决了外星人的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:18,092 --> 00:08:20,595
<font color="white">对于他们持续酿成的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:20,678 --> 00:08:23,306
<font color="white">我们可以继续视而不见吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:24,265 --> 00:08:26,184
<font color="white">这次发生的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:26,267 --> 00:08:29,395
<font color="white">正是我们过去长期忽略的问题</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:29,479 --> 00:08:34,692
<font color="white">变得更严重 进而浮出台面</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:08:36,152 --> 00:08:37,403
<font color="white">这是…</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:08:38,029 --> 00:08:40,114
<font color="white">我做的事吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:08:40,907 --> 00:08:42,075
<font color="white">不对…</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:08:43,576 --> 00:08:45,245
<font color="white">那是不可能的</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:46,454 --> 00:08:49,290
<font color="white">奥特曼其实很危险吧</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:49,374 --> 00:08:53,044
<font color="white">话说奥特曼以为自己很了不起吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:03,972
<font color="white">（涩谷又成为灾区了吗？）</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:04,055 --> 00:09:06,057
<font color="white">（科学特搜队有太多权力</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">根本能与国家军队匹敌）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:09,352
<font color="white">在这种情况下总会有人出来大惊小怪</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:09,978 --> 00:09:11,104
<font color="white">别放在心上</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:12,188 --> 00:09:14,941
<font color="white">我没有放在心上 不过…</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:18,945 --> 00:09:19,988
<font color="white">打扰了</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:22,282 --> 00:09:23,741
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:25,285 --> 00:09:27,120
<font color="white">我回来了</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:09:28,329 --> 00:09:31,541
<font color="white">进次郎 你为什么要做出那种事？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:09:33,501 --> 00:09:35,128
<font color="white">-我没做</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什么？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:09:36,129 --> 00:09:38,339
<font color="white">我什么都没做！</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:38,423 --> 00:09:39,757
<font color="white">不然那到底是怎么…</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:40,842 --> 00:09:41,968
<font color="white">你冷静一点</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,846
<font color="white">对不起</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:46,556 --> 00:09:50,226
<font color="white">进次郎 当时发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:09:51,811 --> 00:09:54,564
<font color="white">我完全不记得了</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:55,607 --> 00:09:56,858
<font color="white">全都不记得？</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:58,067 --> 00:09:59,986
<font color="white">爸联络我后</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:00,612 --> 00:10:03,531
<font color="white">我立刻打算前往典礼会场</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:04,991 --> 00:10:07,577
<font color="white">但没有后续的记忆</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:08,202 --> 00:10:11,372
<font color="white">回过神后 我就倒在大楼旁的巷子里</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:12,498 --> 00:10:16,044
<font color="white">那时现场就已经是那副惨状了</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:16,878 --> 00:10:21,132
<font color="white">不管怎样 我们现在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">只能尽快确认事情的原委了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:22,258 --> 00:10:25,136
<font color="white">如果你想起任何事 立刻告诉我</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:26,137 --> 00:10:27,263
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:29,432 --> 00:10:30,767
<font color="white">另外啊</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:31,893 --> 00:10:37,440
<font color="white">我要暂时禁止你使用装甲</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:38,524 --> 00:10:39,942
<font color="white">也不能出动</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:44,572
<font color="white">那你的意思是…</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:47,867 --> 00:10:48,951
<font color="white">井手先生…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:10:50,870 --> 00:10:54,040
<font color="white">科学特搜队认为是我做出这些事吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:10:54,123 --> 00:10:57,794
<font color="white">很遗憾 不仅仅是那段视频</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:10:58,419 --> 00:11:00,254
<font color="white">装甲的操作数据</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:04,717
<font color="white">也显示出你穿着装甲出现在事发现场</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:06,010 --> 00:11:07,595
<font color="white">不是我做的</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:08,721 --> 00:11:10,390
<font color="white">虽然我说过自己不记得</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:11,641 --> 00:11:13,434
<font color="white">可是真的不是我干的</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:13,518 --> 00:11:15,353
<font color="white">我至少清楚那一点</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:15,436 --> 00:11:17,271
<font color="white">你一点也不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:20,608 --> 00:11:22,693
<font color="white">为了让你的那个主张成立</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:22,777 --> 00:11:25,488
<font color="white">我们只能想办法证明</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你不是那位罪魁祸首</font></font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:30,034
<font color="white">不过就整体状况来看</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那只可能是进次郎…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:30,118 --> 00:11:31,160
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:31,661 --> 00:11:35,665
<font color="white">但数据终究只是数据</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:36,749 --> 00:11:38,126
<font color="white">也可以这么说吧</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:41,295 --> 00:11:45,091
<font color="white">我们现在只能设法验证各种可能性了</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:48,636 --> 00:11:50,096
<font color="white">你能理解吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:00,106
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:12:01,732 --> 00:12:02,692
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:12:03,484 --> 00:12:06,863
<font color="white">我刚刚说得太过分了 对不起</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:08,781
<font color="white">没关系</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:10,032 --> 00:12:11,701
<font color="white">这是井手先生给你的</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:12,285 --> 00:12:13,828
<font color="white">你把手机弄丢了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:14,412 --> 00:12:16,497
<font color="white">他要你暂时先用这台手机</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:18,124 --> 00:12:19,167
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:21,085 --> 00:12:23,963
<font color="white">太郎先生也在怀疑我吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:31,971 --> 00:12:34,474
<font color="white">老实说 我不确定</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:39,187
<font color="white">但我们一定能揭开真相</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:39,270 --> 00:12:40,563
<font color="white">我相信办得到</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:41,230 --> 00:12:44,233
<font color="white">你也要相信自己</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:46,402 --> 00:12:47,403
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:48,070 --> 00:12:50,031
<font color="white">-再见</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那个…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:50,114 --> 00:12:51,616
<font color="white">怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:12:51,699 --> 00:12:56,496
<font color="white">你不知道我爸的联络方式对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:12:56,579 --> 00:12:59,582
<font color="white">对喔 那台手机里可能没有</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:12:59,665 --> 00:13:02,168
<font color="white">我知道了 我马上跟他取得联系</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:02,668 --> 00:13:04,045
<font color="white">谢谢你</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:11,761 --> 00:13:13,012
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:13,596 --> 00:13:15,056
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:15,139 --> 00:13:16,933
<font color="white">很抱歉 井手</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:13:33,908 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">喂？</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:35,993 --> 00:13:36,953
<font color="white">爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:37,662 --> 00:13:38,955
<font color="white">是进次郎吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:39,539 --> 00:13:40,373
<font color="white">是我</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:41,290 --> 00:13:43,751
<font color="white">井手刚刚打给我了</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:44,335 --> 00:13:46,587
<font color="white">我从他那里听说大致的状况了</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:13:46,671 --> 00:13:48,047
<font color="white">发生了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:13:50,132 --> 00:13:51,884
<font color="white">算了 你现在不必告诉我</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:13:53,594 --> 00:13:54,804
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:13:55,555 --> 00:13:59,267
<font color="white">你现在还保留着以前</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">身为奥特曼时的记忆吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:14:02,061 --> 00:14:03,938
<font color="white">我也不清楚</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:14:04,021 --> 00:14:05,982
<font color="white">虽然只是片段的记忆</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:14:06,065 --> 00:14:09,527
<font color="white">应该说我多多少少都还记得</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:14:11,362 --> 00:14:15,032
<font color="white">代表你脑中有来源不明的记忆吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:14:17,535 --> 00:14:20,955
<font color="white">进次郎 你现在在哪里？</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:14:23,583 --> 00:14:25,209
<font color="white">我正打算回家</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:14:26,043 --> 00:14:30,006
<font color="white">我们久违地单独聊一聊吧</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:14:30,089 --> 00:14:32,675
<font color="white">我也正要回家</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:32,758 --> 00:14:34,510
<font color="white">不能在家聊啦</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:14:35,136 --> 00:14:37,179
<font color="white">会害妈妈担心的</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:14:38,055 --> 00:14:39,515
<font color="white">说得也是</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:14:39,599 --> 00:14:42,935
<font color="white">我也不想被你妈责骂</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:14:43,019 --> 00:14:44,020
<font color="white">我想也是</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:14:45,563 --> 00:14:49,150
<font color="white">不如我们去并木公园如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:14:49,233 --> 00:14:51,277
<font color="white">知道了 我立刻过去</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:15:25,019 --> 00:15:26,354
<font color="white">真有一套</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:15:26,938 --> 00:15:29,982
<font color="white">不愧是前光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:15:30,066 --> 00:15:32,860
<font color="white">你是什么人？</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:15:33,861 --> 00:15:36,113
<font color="white">无名受害人</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:15:38,532 --> 00:15:42,828
<font color="white">就把我当成他们的发言人吧</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:16:09,730 --> 00:16:10,898
<font color="white">他很强</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:16:14,485 --> 00:16:15,611
<font color="white">这次又怎么了？</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:16:16,195 --> 00:16:18,072
<font color="white">佐菲装甲被传送了</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:16:18,823 --> 00:16:19,991
<font color="white">你说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:16:20,074 --> 00:16:22,535
<font color="white">-这是怎么回事？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-立刻确认位置</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:16:22,618 --> 00:16:26,288
<font color="white">确认到能量反应</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">他似乎正在与某人交战</font></font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:16:28,249 --> 00:16:29,333
<font color="white">早田吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:16:47,685 --> 00:16:51,647
<font color="white">你袭击我的目的究竟是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:16:51,731 --> 00:16:52,815
<font color="white">回答我！</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:17:01,741 --> 00:17:03,034
<font color="white">真了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:17:05,786 --> 00:17:07,246
<font color="white">你的那股力量</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:17:07,872 --> 00:17:10,583
<font color="white">看来完全没有衰退呢</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:17:12,043 --> 00:17:13,210
<font color="white">那是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:17:14,128 --> 00:17:16,547
<font color="white">那不是奥特曼吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:17:17,173 --> 00:17:18,591
<font color="white">不能在这里战斗</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:17:28,309 --> 00:17:29,435
<font color="white">原来如此</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:17:30,644 --> 00:17:33,064
<font color="white">你不能继续</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:17:33,647 --> 00:17:36,525
<font color="white">破坏奥特曼的名声</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:17:38,027 --> 00:17:39,695
<font color="white">是这样没错吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:24,949 --> 00:18:28,494
<font color="white">（并木公园）</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:31,914 --> 00:18:33,040
<font color="white">怪了</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:18:33,624 --> 00:18:35,876
<font color="white">我比爸还早到吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:18:36,961 --> 00:18:40,131
<font color="white">科学特搜队直升机102号 紧急出动</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:18:40,798 --> 00:18:44,176
<font color="white">科学特搜队直升机102号 紧急出动</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:18:46,095 --> 00:18:47,263
<font color="white">诸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:18:47,805 --> 00:18:49,849
<font color="white">这次又出了什么事？</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:18:49,932 --> 00:18:52,893
<font color="white">早田先生似乎正在跟某人交战</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:18:52,977 --> 00:18:54,562
<font color="white">我们要去确认状况</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:18:55,229 --> 00:18:56,897
<font color="white">-早田先生吗？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-怎么了？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:18:57,857 --> 00:19:00,151
<font color="white">没事 进次郎呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:19:00,234 --> 00:19:02,528
<font color="white">那小子现在帮不上任何忙</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:04,572
<font color="white">告诉他也没用</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:19:44,653 --> 00:19:45,779
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:19:56,248 --> 00:20:01,253
<font color="white">像这样隐密地战斗也不赖吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:20:02,546 --> 00:20:04,798
<font color="white">真符合你的风格</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:20:05,424 --> 00:20:06,508
<font color="white">不过…</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:20:09,511 --> 00:20:10,763
<font color="white">对了</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:20:11,472 --> 00:20:14,642
<font color="white">我想到一件剧本中没有写的事</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:20:18,646 --> 00:20:23,442
<font color="white">若英雄无法向大众</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">展现大显身手的模样</font></font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:20:25,027 --> 00:20:28,113
<font color="white">就丝毫没有存在的必要</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:28,656 --> 00:20:31,116
<font color="white">你不这么认为吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:31,784 --> 00:20:33,118
<font color="white">你在说什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:37,539 --> 00:20:38,874
<font color="white">那是什么啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:42,586
<font color="white">给我住手！</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:20:58,852 --> 00:21:00,479
<font color="white">真是了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:21:01,063 --> 00:21:03,190
<font color="white">像你这样的人</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:21:03,274 --> 00:21:06,235
<font color="white">一定愿意保护民众的性命</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:21:07,528 --> 00:21:09,154
<font color="white">我早就料到了</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:21:15,494 --> 00:21:16,578
<font color="white">那是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:21:17,955 --> 00:21:20,749
<font color="white">你到底有什么目的？</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:21:21,417 --> 00:21:24,837
<font color="white">是时候结束这一切了</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:37,766
<font color="white">爸！</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:22:03,542 --> 00:22:06,712
<font color="white">佐菲装甲断线了</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:22:06,795 --> 00:22:08,130
<font color="white">早田！</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻译：蒋文昊</font><font color="white"></font>

